FIX44-SecuritiesLending.xml is derived from the FIX44.xml resource distributed
with org.quickfixj:quickfixj-messages-fix44:2.3.2. The local additions are the
bilateral U1/U2/U3 messages and fields 9001, 9002, and 9003.

QuickFIX/J project and license information:
https://github.com/quickfix-j/quickfixj

FIX specifications and field definitions originate with FIX Trading Community:
https://www.fixtrading.org/

These custom messages are a demo bilateral agreement, not an official FIX
Trading Community securities-lending application specification.
